  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "E",
  "Solution": "Since \\(\\pi>3\\), the number \\(3-\\pi\\) is negative. The absolute value of a negative number is its opposite, so\n\\[\n|3-\\pi|=-(3-\\pi)=\\pi-3.\n\\]\nThe exact value is \\(\\pi-3\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{E}\\).",
